[{"answer":"Hello, Mrs Sutton. Come in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How are you settling in next door?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/2-2024-12-14-00-06-14.mp3"},{"answer":"Have all your things from Canada arrived yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought I saw a removals van outside your house yesterday afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. They came yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We spent all day yesterday arranging them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It's beginning to feel a bit more like home now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh that's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, come in and sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you alright?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/10.mp3"},{"answer":"You look a bit worried.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I am a bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry to bother you so early, Mrs Smith, but","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder if you could help me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me how I can get hold of a doctor?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Our daughter, Anna, isn't very well this morning and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I may have to call somebody out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/17.mp3"},{"answer":"She keeps being sick and I am beginning to get a bit worried.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I just don't know how the health system works here in England.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/19.mp3"},{"answer":"All I know is that it's very different from ours back in Canada.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't know really where to start.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first thing you have to do is find a family doctor -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/23.mp3"},{"answer":"sometimes we call them general practitioners as well -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and register with him or her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/25.mp3"},{"answer":"If you live here, you've got to be on a doctor's list.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/26.mp3"},{"answer":"If you're not, things can be a bit difficult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Nobody will come out to you if you're not registered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, they work in things called practices.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Sort of small groups of family doctors all working together in the same building.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what you've got to do this morning is register with one of them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/31.mp3"},{"answer":"There are two practices near here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/32.mp3"},{"answer":"so we're quite well off for doctors in this part of Manchester.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/33.mp3"},{"answer":"There's the Dean End Health Centre about ten minutes' walk away","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's another practice in South Hay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/35.mp3"},{"answer":"That's about five minutes away going towards the town centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/36.mp3"},{"answer":"We're registered at the Dean End one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/37.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're both okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/38.mp3"},{"answer":"There are about six doctors in our practice and four in the other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So ours is quite big in comparison.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And the building and everything's a bit more modern.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/41.mp3"},{"answer":"South Hay is a bit old-fashioned but the doctors are okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Their only problem is that they don't have a proper appointment system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes you have to wait for ages there to see someone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, you go to the receptionist in whichever health centre","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/45.mp3"},{"answer":"and ask her to register you with a doctor there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/46.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to fill in a form, but it doesn't take long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Ours is called Dr Jones","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/48.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've been going to him for years -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/49.mp3"},{"answer":"ever since we moved here fifteen years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't say he's brilliant but I suppose he's alright really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/51.mp3"},{"answer":"We're used to him now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/52.mp3"},{"answer":"They say he's very good with elderly people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/53.mp3"},{"answer":"but he does tend to get a bit impatient with children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Listen, the one who's supposed to be really good with small children is Dr Shaw.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I've heard lots of people say that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/56.mp3"},{"answer":"She's young and she's got small children of her own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/57.mp3"},{"answer":"So you could try registering with her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And if her list's full,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard somebody say the other day that there's a really nice young doctor at South Hay,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/60.mp3"},{"answer":"a Dr Williams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/61.mp3"},{"answer":"He holds special clinics for people with back trouble.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/62.mp3"},{"answer":"But that's not really your problem, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/63.mp3"},{"answer":"If you want a doctor to visit you at home,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/64.mp3"},{"answer":"you have to ask for a home visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/65.mp3"},{"answer":"You're supposed to do that before 10.30 in the morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/66.mp3"},{"answer":"but obviously, if it's an emergency, you can phone at any time, night or day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It might not be your doctor that comes, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/68.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite often one of the other doctors in the practice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/69.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't really seem to make much difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Otherwise you make an appointment to see your doctor at the health centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/71.mp3"},{"answer":"You usually get seen the same day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Not always of course, but usually, as I say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/73.mp3"},{"answer":"They hold surgeries between 9 and 11.30 every weekday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and from 4 to 6.30 Monday to Thursday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Saturdays are only for emergencies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/76.mp3"},{"answer":"When the doctor sees you, he gives you a prescription.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/77.mp3"},{"answer":"He writes what medication you need on it and you take it to a chemist's shop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/78.mp3"},{"answer":"There's one opposite the centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/79.mp3"},{"answer":"If it's for a child under 16, you don't have to pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/80.mp3"},{"answer":"So if it's for Anna, there's no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/81.mp3"},{"answer":"The same thing goes if you're unemployed or retired, or if you're pregnant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Just as well because it's not cheap.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/83.mp3"},{"answer":"You pay the same price for each item the doctor has prescribed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/84.mp3"},{"answer":"At the moment it's something like £5 per item.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/85.mp3"},{"answer":"So you pay for the medication but the consultation with the doctor doesn't cost you anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/86.mp3"},{"answer":"It's completely free as long as you're a resident here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/87.mp3"},{"answer":"You're going to be here for three years, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/88.mp3"},{"answer":"So there shouldn't be any question of you paying anything to see the doctor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/89.mp3"},{"answer":"So that's one less problem to worry about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, Mrs Sutton. If you want,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/91.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll sit with your daughter for half an hour if you want to go down to the health centre to register.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/92.mp3"},{"answer":"It's no trouble really, don't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/93.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you sure you wouldn't mind?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/94.mp3"},{"answer":"That would really help me a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/95.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll ask them if they can send someone round later to see Anna.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/96.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll try the Dean End Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/98.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry about Anna.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/99.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I'll be back as soon as I can.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-2-2023-08-14-20-26-52/100.mp3"}]
